{"id":"610891","name":"萝卜粉条豆腐煎包","author":"雨中漫步li","authorId":"10274398","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/610891/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"200克"},{"name":"粉条","amount":"适量"},{"name":"豆腐","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"肉馅","amount":"适量"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"2克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"萝卜、豆腐准备好。","img":"images/610891/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"萝卜去皮切片。","img":"images/610891/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅内加水烧开，放入萝卜焯水1分钟。","img":"images/610891/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"萝卜搅碎。","img":"images/610891/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"豆腐切小块。","img":"images/610891/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅内放玉米油，倒入豆腐炒制金黄。","img":"images/610891/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"粉条放锅里煮好。","img":"images/610891/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"切碎。","img":"images/610891/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"猪肉馅里面放蚝油、生抽、姜拌匀腌制20分钟。","img":"images/610891/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"所有食材放在一起，放入花椒粉、芝麻油、盐调味。","img":"images/610891/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"拌匀备用。","img":"images/610891/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"提前和好的面团，揉面排气。","img":"images/610891/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"分成均匀的剂子，擀成包子皮。","img":"images/610891/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放入馅料，收口即可。","img":"images/610891/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"锅内放油烧热，放入包子，煎至底部金黄。","img":"images/610891/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"倒入3：1清水，烧开。","img":"images/610891/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"盖上锅盖，小火烧10分钟。","img":"images/610891/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"锅内水分收干，撒黑芝麻。","img":"images/610891/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/610891/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"萝卜包子，好吃极了。","img":"images/610891/step_20.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}